    Payment processing. Subject to Google's terms of service.

  • Google AdMob (https://admob.google.com/)
    Advertising SDK. Subject to Google's terms of service.
    Shown to users who have not purchased a Supporter tier.

Third-party components retain their own licenses. This license does not
